# the effects, as a hand has them, on the Space page (the FX button): the left two knobs are the keys', the right two the melody's. SEL + KNOB 1-4: the keys' effect, their Motion, the melody's effect, its Motion. FX held + KNOB 1-4: Echo and Reverb of each. GLO held + KNOB 1, 3: Depth of each. The four knobs as ever otherwise; each piece keeps its own; a save keeps them, range-checked; an older save is not read. What it does to the sound: tests/host/fx_test.c
wait 300
expect unfit 0
expect par36 0
expect par37 50
expect par38 50
expect par39 100
expect par40 100
expect par41 0
expect par42 50
expect par43 50
expect par44 100
expect par45 100
expect enagree 0
listen
tap FX
wait 300
said Space page: Echo 40, Echo time 1/4., Reverb 65, Size 80
shot space_off.png
# ---- SEL + KNOB 1: the keys' effect, a detent at a time, round. The page's knob does not move, no Degrees come
press SEL
spin K1 1
expect par36 1
expect par20 40
said KEYS EFFECT Chorus
spin K1 1
expect par36 2
spin K1 1
expect par36 3
spin K1 1
expect par36 4
spin K1 1
expect par36 0
spin K1 -1
expect par36 4
spin K1 -1
spin K1 -1
spin K1 -1
expect par36 1
expect view 5
# ---- SEL + KNOB 2: its Motion, as a knob: to its ends and no further
wait 300
spin K2 3
expect par37 53
said KEYS MOTION 53
setpar 37 99
wait 300
spin K2 3
expect par37 100
wait 300
spin K2 -3
expect par37 97
# ---- SEL + KNOB 3 and 4: the melody's
spin K3 -1
expect par41 4
said MELODY EFFECT Filter
wait 300
spin K4 -1
expect par42 49
said MELODY MOTION 49
setpar 42 30
release SEL
wait 50
expect view 5
expect par20 40
expect par21 3
expect par22 65
expect par23 80
expect enagree 0
# ---- what the header has, and what the page says
wait 2000
shot space_fx.png
listen
tap ENV
wait 300
tap FX
wait 300
said Space page: Echo 40, Echo time 1/4., Reverb 65, Size 80. Keys effect Chorus, motion 97, depth 50. Melody effect Filter, motion 30, depth 50
# ---- FX held + KNOB 1-4: the sends. The page stays, nothing else moves
press FX
spin K1 -2
expect par39 98
said KEYS ECHO 98
wait 300
spin K2 2
expect par40 102
said KEYS REVERB 102
wait 300
spin K3 1
expect par44 101
said MELODY ECHO 101
wait 300
spin K4 -1
expect par45 99
said MELODY REVERB 99
setpar 39 60
setpar 40 120
setpar 44 199
setpar 45 1
wait 300
spin K3 3
expect par44 200
wait 300
spin K4 -3
expect par45 0
release FX
wait 100
expect view 5
expect par20 40
expect par21 3
expect par22 65
expect par23 80
expect help 0
# ---- GLO held + KNOB 1, 3: Depth. The page stays: GLO's release is not a page, now. KNOB 2, 4 under it do nothing at all
press GLO
spin K1 3
expect par38 53
said KEYS DEPTH 53
wait 300
spin K3 -2
expect par43 48
said MELODY DEPTH 48
setpar 38 80
setpar 43 40
wait 300
spin K2 3
wait 300
spin K4 -2
release GLO
wait 100
expect view 5
expect par21 3
expect par23 80
expect enagree 0
expect unfit 0
# ---- a turn and nothing else under GLO: its release is still no page
press GLO
wait 300
spin K3 1
release GLO
wait 100
expect view 5
expect par43 41
setpar 43 40
# ---- GLO and FX alone still are what they are. A card still comes, and says this
press FX
wait 1000
expect help 1
said SEL: EFFECT, MOTION
release FX
wait 100
expect view 5
tap GLO
wait 100
expect view 6
# ---- elsewhere, none of this: GLO + a knob on Setup, FX + a knob on Setup, SEL + a knob on Setup are the knobs (as ever)
press SEL
spin K2 1
expect par25 1
spin K2 -1
release SEL
press GLO
spin K2 1
expect par25 1
spin K2 -1
release GLO
wait 50
expect view 6
tap HOME
wait 100
press FX
spin K2 1
expect par1 71
spin K2 -1
expect par1 70
release FX
wait 100
expect view 5
# ---- Space again, a plain knob: its own value
wait 300
spin K1 3
expect par20 43
wait 300
spin K1 -3
expect par20 40
# ---- the switches and the Degrees: SEL + FX is still the hats, and it still is after a turn
expect mutehats 1
press SEL
tap FX
release SEL
wait 100
expect mutehats 0
press SEL
tap FX
release SEL
wait 100
expect mutehats 1
